//
// Both images are four flat colour blocks, so decoded output can be checked
// for orientation: top-left red, top-right green, bottom-left blue,
// bottom-right yellow.
//
// Regenerate (Python, pillow-heif):
//   pillow_heif.register_heif_opener(); Image.new(...).save('x.heic', quality=90)

